  <name>Desktop Destroyer</name>
  <summary>Smash, burn and saw your desktop to pieces</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      The 90s classic for Linux: hammer, chain-saw, machine gun,
      flame-thrower, colour-thrower, phaser, stamp, termites and washing gun,
      let loose on a still of your real desktop. Your windows and files are
      never touched; Esc quits, R repairs everything. Works on X11 and
      Wayland.
    </p>
  </description>
